name>MASUDA, YUKIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NT ENGINEERING KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOMAI YASUHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MASUDA YUKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOMAI, YASUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MASUDA, YUKIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A tool holder (18) is provided with a transmitting/receiving system (20) for radio communications with a controller (22). A transmitter includes an oscillator circuit (78) for generating a plurality of carriers of different frequencies at the same time, and a direct FM modulator circuit (76) and an indirect FM modulator circuit (86) that modulate the carriers with a signal. A receiver includes a gate switch circuit that enables evaluation of the signal wave only when a plurality of carriers are received at the same time. The tool holder (18) can communicate with the external controller (22) in reliable manner by avoiding disturbances.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un porte-outil (18) muni d'un système (20) émetteur/récepteur servant à des communications par radio avec un contrôleur (22). L'émetteur comporte un circuit oscillant (78) produisant simultanément plusieurs porteuses de différentes fréquences, un circuit modulateur FM direct (76), et un circuit modulateur FM indirect (76), modulant les porteuses par un signal. Le récepteur comporte un circuit à commutation de portes ne pouvant évaluer l'onde du signal que quand plusieurs porteuses sont reçues simultanément. Le porte-outil (18) peut communiquer fiablement avec le contrôleur extérieur (22) en évitant les perturbations.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>